"""0.60: spell fusions. Three per class: (1) two of its own spells, (2) a spell + the class's favourite weapon type
(Crâ Arc, Iop Épée, Féca Bâton, Eniripsa Baguette, Sram Dague, Osamodas Marteau, Sadida Bâton, Enutrof Pelle, Ecaflip
Épée, Xélor Marteau, Pandawa Hache; the Sacrieur, the Roublard and the Brigandin have a second spell + spell fusion),
(3) a spell + a global spell. Offered once both are at their maximum level (the weapon too); a fusion replaces its
spells (the weapon stays) and frees their slot. Each one is named after a real Dofus Retro spell (names in 7 languages
from work/lang_json/spells_<lg>.json; the Roublard's and the Brigandin's are monster spells of the same files) and plays
that spell's own client effect (tools/assets/build_fx060.py) on its hits; icons: tools/assets/build_fusionicons060.py.
A fused spell = its main ingredient at level 6 (type, effect, animation, sound), merged with the other's signature,
a rider (the effect on every hit: r* params, game.js riderHit) and a damage factor CAL calibrated with the spell bench
(BENCH=… node tools/checks/sim_node.js) so that it beats the two spells cast side by side (x1.25), or the spell alone x1.6 for
the weapon fusions (the weapon is kept). apply(C, put_ui) is called by patch_060."""
